  "title": "China's Climate and Flood Resilience Measures in Tibet and Beyond",
  "summary": "China's censors removed videos of a disaster in Tibet and Nepal from social media, while China warns of a lake near the border with Nepal-Tibet, potentially causing floods. The government in India revised floodplain measures, and a typhoon in eastern China caused evacuations.",
